{
  "version": "tts-20261125T023616",
  "generatedAt": "2026-11-25T02:36:16.645Z",
  "voice": "x6_zhantingnvjiedai_pro",
  "count": 51,
  "items": [
    {
      "kind": "stage",
      "id": "stage-0-0",
      "title": "地下开采 · 第1档",
      "stage": 0,
      "depth": 0,
      "text": "地下开采。很多油藏中的石油赋存在岩石的孔隙和裂缝中。井筒把地面与储层连接起来，具体怎样采出还要看地下条件。",
      "hash": "3dc2b4cc3c156f797c25d21032e9405e231d53e00a5919a533eaa90b60273131",
      "file": "tts/3dc2b4cc3c156f797c25d21032e9405e231d53e00a5919a533eaa90b60273131.mp3",
      "bytes": 68688
    },
    {
      "kind": "stage",
      "id": "stage-0-1",
      "title": "地下开采 · 第2档",
      "stage": 0,
      "depth": 1,
      "text": "地下开采。地下开采先建立井筒通道，再根据储层和流体条件组织生产。这里用一口井说明从地下到地面的连接。",
      "hash": "41f139ca4efce15777ffd7453da92af0ae02ee5012ac6e94ad091478d4d8f313",
      "file": "tts/41f139ca4efce15777ffd7453da92af0ae02ee5012ac6e94ad091478d4d8f313.mp3",
      "bytes": 65520
    },
    {
      "kind": "stage",
      "id": "stage-0-2",
      "title": "地下开采 · 第3档",
      "stage": 0,
      "depth": 2,
      "text": "地下开采。井型、储层特征和采油方式需要分别理解。井筒提供通道，产出能力还取决于储层流体与相应开发条件。",
      "hash": "ea4f73c81c9a3910fe3f123cf0bc3790b21dc1650b340c087a0772c74ddde1c4",
      "file": "tts/ea4f73c81c9a3910fe3f123cf0bc3790b21dc1650b340c087a0772c74ddde1c4.mp3",
      "bytes": 64080
    },
    {
      "kind": "stage",
      "id": "stage-0-3",
      "title": "地下开采 · 第4档",
      "stage": 0,
      "depth": 3,
      "text": "地下开采。本环节呈现井筒与储层的连接关系。不同井况涉及不同完井及举升方案，进一步研读需结合具体储层、井况与工程资料。",
      "hash": "725482f37d2455588d391c40c4dac471ff99c08f7518fb0edc194ee6f2d3fd5c",
      "file": "tts/725482f37d2455588d391c40c4dac471ff99c08f7518fb0edc194ee6f2d3fd5c.mp3",
      "bytes": 76320
    },
    {
      "kind": "stage",
      "id": "stage-1-0",
      "title": "地面处理 · 第1档",
      "stage": 1,
      "depth": 0,
      "text": "地面处理。刚从井里出来的东西，可能是油、气和水等的混合物。进入后面的流程之前，需要进行相应处理。",
      "hash": "7109248fa4c05ada0f90af0a5985a190b3ea9649c26f523ac5a65f1a9b357c1c",
      "file": "tts/7109248fa4c05ada0f90af0a5985a190b3ea9649c26f523ac5a65f1a9b357c1c.mp3",
      "bytes": 60768
    },
    {
      "kind": "stage",
      "id": "stage-1-1",
      "title": "地面处理 · 第2档",
      "stage": 1,
      "depth": 1,
      "text": "地面处理。井口产出物可能包含多种组分。地面设施按实际工艺进行分离和处理，为后续储存、输送提供条件。",
      "hash": "6ec456df847021fb5775e750c76db0639f80d3aae644f30b368612cc72bfa466",
      "file": "tts/6ec456df847021fb5775e750c76db0639f80d3aae644f30b368612cc72bfa466.mp3",
      "bytes": 66528
    },
    {
      "kind": "stage",
      "id": "stage-1-2",
      "title": "地面处理 · 第3档",
      "stage": 1,
      "depth": 2,
      "text": "地面处理。地面处理连接井口生产与后续输送。分离、脱水等具体环节和要求，应结合实际产出物及工艺资料解释。",
      "hash": "7a56d797a9f20985c5cd5f5542cd3416bd5811cda0e65eb33011357bd67e4d0a",
      "file": "tts/7a56d797a9f20985c5cd5f5542cd3416bd5811cda0e65eb33011357bd67e4d0a.mp3",
      "bytes": 67248
    },
    {
      "kind": "stage",
      "id": "stage-1-3",
      "title": "地面处理 · 第4档",
      "stage": 1,
      "depth": 3,
      "text": "地面处理。地面处理的单元和边界取决于产出物流体性质及下游要求。本图仅呈现处理环节的位置，实际流程与设备需按工程资料核对。",
      "hash": "c10694866d7c35d2a8e515e5e2ec8ac547e3eb9a846b1c2213f0ed563d4e68ab",
      "file": "tts/c10694866d7c35d2a8e515e5e2ec8ac547e3eb9a846b1c2213f0ed563d4e68ab.mp3",
      "bytes": 78192
    },
    {
      "kind": "stage",
      "id": "stage-2-0",
      "title": "储运 · 第1档",
      "stage": 2,
      "depth": 0,
      "text": "储运。处理后的原油，通过相应设施储存和输送，继续前往炼厂。储罐与管线在旅程中承担不同的任务。",
      "hash": "81f24d01bf72b2f52ce6cadd020ba9f86e5359d2aebcf4e10b44809566bdb35c",
      "file": "tts/81f24d01bf72b2f52ce6cadd020ba9f86e5359d2aebcf4e10b44809566bdb35c.mp3",
      "bytes": 60192
    },
    {
      "kind": "stage",
      "id": "stage-2-1",
      "title": "储运 · 第2档",
      "stage": 2,
      "depth": 1,
      "text": "储运。储存与输送连接生产端和加工端。储罐、管道及其他运输方式按实际场景配合使用。",
      "hash": "3de6b097376320588c0d474c7d1fb4e06a8e12f792b98d77ee0deb32997e7ff3",
      "file": "tts/3de6b097376320588c0d474c7d1fb4e06a8e12f792b98d77ee0deb32997e7ff3.mp3",
      "bytes": 56880
    },
    {
      "kind": "stage",
      "id": "stage-2-2",
      "title": "储运 · 第3档",
      "stage": 2,
      "depth": 2,
      "text": "储运。储运环节需要结合物料性质、设施和运输方式理解。流程图中的单条管线用于表达物料连接。",
      "hash": "262b3b512735b80c14c6179cfe2b19fe60273f99d3c4f8b8b2d43f40685f0ab5",
      "file": "tts/262b3b512735b80c14c6179cfe2b19fe60273f99d3c4f8b8b2d43f40685f0ab5.mp3",
      "bytes": 59472
    },
    {
      "kind": "stage",
      "id": "stage-2-3",
      "title": "储运 · 第4档",
      "stage": 2,
      "depth": 3,
      "text": "储运。储运方案涉及物料、设施及运行边界。当前模型表达环节连接，具体设备、物性与运行条件应依据实际资料展开。",
      "hash": "a619d21d3376bb1ef7e6cb4c2d1bdf1261a73ad4c865678d07205c2a12154ca8",
      "file": "tts/a619d21d3376bb1ef7e6cb4c2d1bdf1261a73ad4c865678d07205c2a12154ca8.mp3",
      "bytes": 71712
    },
    {
      "kind": "stage",
      "id": "stage-3-0",
      "title": "炼化 · 第1档",
      "stage": 3,
      "depth": 0,
      "text": "炼化。原油会经过分离、转化和处理等加工，逐步成为燃料或化工原料。它的用途来自多种加工过程。",
      "hash": "9c9f16da8822b850d576382ea172f0408c329ca5591abb911b177510fa6dcd29",
      "file": "tts/9c9f16da8822b850d576382ea172f0408c329ca5591abb911b177510fa6dcd29.mp3",
      "bytes": 60192
    },
    {
      "kind": "stage",
      "id": "stage-3-1",
      "title": "炼化 · 第2档",
      "stage": 3,
      "depth": 1,
      "text": "炼化。炼厂通过分离、转化和处理等环节加工原油。不同加工环节承担不同作用，最后形成相应产品。",
      "hash": "5dba85be4b30c5c484ddc4f792e86151290bb07d0c6af62ed42a73d05692677e",
      "file": "tts/5dba85be4b30c5c484ddc4f792e86151290bb07d0c6af62ed42a73d05692677e.mp3",
      "bytes": 60480
    },
    {
      "kind": "stage",
      "id": "stage-3-2",
      "title": "炼化 · 第3档",
      "stage": 3,
      "depth": 2,
      "text": "炼化。蒸馏分离和分子转化是不同的过程。炼厂中的加工单元组合及产品路线，需结合实际工艺理解。",
      "hash": "75b781012d44a532f98c96b46bfc766be63a4e54d8c4f48230804d325ba2499b",
      "file": "tts/75b781012d44a532f98c96b46bfc766be63a4e54d8c4f48230804d325ba2499b.mp3",
      "bytes": 60768
    },
    {
      "kind": "stage",
      "id": "stage-3-3",
      "title": "炼化 · 第4档",
      "stage": 3,
      "depth": 3,
      "text": "炼化。本模型用塔器和连接关系表示炼化环节。分离、转化及处理的具体单元、物流与产品路线，需结合已审定的工艺资料研读。",
      "hash": "e6b46d73f4148fe34af438a614e0d364f226231617d385213454d48e3c7b053c",
      "file": "tts/e6b46d73f4148fe34af438a614e0d364f226231617d385213454d48e3c7b053c.mp3",
      "bytes": 79200
    },
    {
      "kind": "stage",
      "id": "stage-4-0",
      "title": "产品去向 · 第1档",
      "stage": 4,
      "depth": 0,
      "text": "产品去向。经过加工，石油可以成为燃料，也能提供制造材料的原料。继续观察它们与交通和日常用品的联系。",
      "hash": "e7bd36a72cada182113f18dacd64d1bbeb8343b84ecf05a9318a6d14a911bb64",
      "file": "tts/e7bd36a72cada182113f18dacd64d1bbeb8343b84ecf05a9318a6d14a911bb64.mp3",
      "bytes": 60480
    },
    {
      "kind": "stage",
      "id": "stage-4-1",
      "title": "产品去向 · 第2档",
      "stage": 4,
      "depth": 1,
      "text": "产品去向。石油产品用于交通、供能等领域，也可作为化工原料。具体生活用品的原料与制造路线需要分别核实。",
      "hash": "6f749c5df351bc15fae5e6de3ab9feb465081779877e0fbddc015855aab78b07",
      "file": "tts/6f749c5df351bc15fae5e6de3ab9feb465081779877e0fbddc015855aab78b07.mp3",
      "bytes": 62352
    },
    {
      "kind": "stage",
      "id": "stage-4-2",
      "title": "产品去向 · 第3档",
      "stage": 4,
      "depth": 2,
      "text": "产品去向。从原油到日常产品，需要经过相应炼化及制造环节。产品用途与材料组成应沿具体路线解释。",
      "hash": "85b3fa13e260b0f16940d267a2b51eaeadf3b4adbcdb13400fb7888ee18cc5db",
      "file": "tts/85b3fa13e260b0f16940d267a2b51eaeadf3b4adbcdb13400fb7888ee18cc5db.mp3",
      "bytes": 62928
    },
    {
      "kind": "stage",
      "id": "stage-4-3",
      "title": "产品去向 · 第4档",
      "stage": 4,
      "depth": 3,
      "text": "产品去向。终端产品和化工原料具有不同的规格及下游路线。本图呈现用途方向，进一步资料应对应具体产品、组成和加工路径。",
      "hash": "edc9623e2c2c0787c0e3f67a6a852a8f621f94798cbafc5d8e8e4cfa24c3da67",
      "file": "tts/edc9623e2c2c0787c0e3f67a6a852a8f621f94798cbafc5d8e8e4cfa24c3da67.mp3",
      "bytes": 71712
    },
    {
      "kind": "device",
      "id": "device-underground_geology",
      "title": "地下地质剖面",
      "objectId": "underground_geology",
      "stage": 0,
      "text": "地下地质剖面。上覆地层、盖层、储层和基底是教学分层；真实油藏还要看构造、岩性和流体条件。",
      "hash": "658921085b4b9e405b2a630148164fb7dc51bd429103a9015bb146a50a9a87cd",
      "file": "tts/658921085b4b9e405b2a630148164fb7dc51bd429103a9015bb146a50a9a87cd.mp3",
      "bytes": 62928
    },
    {
      "kind": "device",
      "id": "device-reservoir",
      "title": "储层",
      "objectId": "reservoir",
      "stage": 0,
      "text": "储层。储层岩石有孔隙和裂缝，油、气、水赋存其中；孔隙大小和连通性影响流动，但不等于真实产能。",
      "hash": "0c2772ea5eb4ec0edab767011df19fe2b4aadfa11be2241d2aee759c21191857",
      "file": "tts/0c2772ea5eb4ec0edab767011df19fe2b4aadfa11be2241d2aee759c21191857.mp3",
      "bytes": 69120
    },
    {
      "kind": "device",
      "id": "device-wellbore",
      "title": "井筒 / 套管",
      "objectId": "wellbore",
      "stage": 0,
      "text": "井筒 / 套管。井筒连接储层与地面；套管加固井壁，水泥环封隔层位，射孔段让储层流体进入井筒。",
      "hash": "52f751fcd844939ba6bb9b5615e6781fa0eeb4654bbcd5233f5c5a25893b4267",
      "file": "tts/52f751fcd844939ba6bb9b5615e6781fa0eeb4654bbcd5233f5c5a25893b4267.mp3",
      "bytes": 61920
    },
    {
      "kind": "device",
      "id": "device-three_phase_separator",
      "title": "三相分离器",
      "objectId": "three_phase_separator",
      "stage": 1,
      "text": "三相分离器。按密度与相态把井口产出物分成气、油、水三路，再分别送去处理或储存。",
      "hash": "6c3a961ef378b3ce85c29e0ffaba5b0fcf95aa9b5977a7ce89f38a46a43ab8cb",
      "file": "tts/6c3a961ef378b3ce85c29e0ffaba5b0fcf95aa9b5977a7ce89f38a46a43ab8cb.mp3",
      "bytes": 60048
    },
    {
      "kind": "device",
      "id": "device-pumpjack",
      "title": "抽油机",
      "objectId": "pumpjack",
      "stage": 0,
      "text": "抽油机。把地面动力转成上下往复运动，通过抽油杆带动井下泵，把油举升到地面。",
      "hash": "5a19a91e497583148adafb2a2a49ad6753763a154ad83acfd8e39f00b150625f",
      "file": "tts/5a19a91e497583148adafb2a2a49ad6753763a154ad83acfd8e39f00b150625f.mp3",
      "bytes": 49248
    },
    {
      "kind": "device",
      "id": "device-wellhead",
      "title": "井口采油树",
      "objectId": "wellhead",
      "stage": 0,
      "text": "井口采油树。井口阀组控制油流开关与压力，把地下产出的流体安全导入集输管线。",
      "hash": "55ce8b3891c9c3814967dd881f853fb6d712bd0794a18f62db00153b966cb00e",
      "file": "tts/55ce8b3891c9c3814967dd881f853fb6d712bd0794a18f62db00153b966cb00e.mp3",
      "bytes": 48672
    },
    {
      "kind": "device",
      "id": "device-fixed_roof_tank",
      "title": "固定顶储罐",
      "objectId": "fixed_roof_tank",
      "stage": 2,
      "text": "固定顶储罐。罐顶固定，液位下降时罐内油气空间变大；需要呼吸阀与油气处理。",
      "hash": "a015bf6fdab023feaa584f36fbb4f90bba98bb1c4f86543baf8be7dec9b53f16",
      "file": "tts/a015bf6fdab023feaa584f36fbb4f90bba98bb1c4f86543baf8be7dec9b53f16.mp3",
      "bytes": 50832
    },
    {
      "kind": "device",
      "id": "device-floating_roof_tank",
      "title": "外浮顶储罐",
      "objectId": "floating_roof_tank",
      "stage": 2,
      "text": "外浮顶储罐。浮盘随液位升降、紧贴油面，油气空间小；但损耗仍受密封、附件与操作影响。",
      "hash": "e6d648894722f0108ff02f10029bd8491d2b9bb823233fbfb0fc5c276f324295",
      "file": "tts/e6d648894722f0108ff02f10029bd8491d2b9bb823233fbfb0fc5c276f324295.mp3",
      "bytes": 61920
    },
    {
      "kind": "device",
      "id": "device-atmospheric_tower",
      "title": "常压蒸馏塔",
      "objectId": "atmospheric_tower",
      "stage": 3,
      "text": "常压蒸馏塔。塔板让上升油气与下降回流液反复接触，按沸点范围在不同高度分出馏分。",
      "hash": "8c381e81dfc31558946188ce6c8add0decb8e709540c4c562850b744401ef53f",
      "file": "tts/8c381e81dfc31558946188ce6c8add0decb8e709540c4c562850b744401ef53f.mp3",
      "bytes": 54432
    },
    {
      "kind": "device",
      "id": "device-vacuum_tower",
      "title": "减压蒸馏塔",
      "objectId": "vacuum_tower",
      "stage": 3,
      "text": "减压蒸馏塔。降低压力可降低沸点，让重油在较低温度继续分离，避免高温裂解。",
      "hash": "f97ddbbb70525366054892bc9f80ae645f9ec0ee737b0867a562bd6cc6a630d6",
      "file": "tts/f97ddbbb70525366054892bc9f80ae645f9ec0ee737b0867a562bd6cc6a630d6.mp3",
      "bytes": 49392
    },
    {
      "kind": "device",
      "id": "device-heater",
      "title": "加热炉",
      "objectId": "heater",
      "stage": 3,
      "text": "加热炉。把热量经炉管传给原油，使其部分汽化；温度过高会导致裂解，改变产品结构。",
      "hash": "aae6423a02c53aefefb5ba1d1c5494909f1563d74323befe66e58fd5456e4fc7",
      "file": "tts/aae6423a02c53aefefb5ba1d1c5494909f1563d74323befe66e58fd5456e4fc7.mp3",
      "bytes": 52992
    },
    {
      "kind": "device",
      "id": "device-fuel_dispenser",
      "title": "加油机",
      "objectId": "fuel_dispenser",
      "stage": 4,
      "text": "加油机。炼厂产出的燃料经调和、储运与配送，最终到达加油站。",
      "hash": "f0813ba733dbff0fe4504c00f38c3f7f87aa19cc97a923ab5b02c123d924bff8",
      "file": "tts/f0813ba733dbff0fe4504c00f38c3f7f87aa19cc97a923ab5b02c123d924bff8.mp3",
      "bytes": 42480
    },
    {
      "kind": "device",
      "id": "device-plastic_bottle",
      "title": "塑料瓶",
      "objectId": "plastic_bottle",
      "stage": 4,
      "text": "塑料瓶。塑料可由石油路线生产，也可能来自天然气、煤基或生物基原料，不能一概而论。",
      "hash": "319dcbcd16400cdbd9d9f91ff30391de6e52614ce583eb88be3d8497d8bd722e",
      "file": "tts/319dcbcd16400cdbd9d9f91ff30391de6e52614ce583eb88be3d8497d8bd722e.mp3",
      "bytes": 52272
    },
    {
      "kind": "device",
      "id": "device-fiber_spool",
      "title": "合成纤维",
      "objectId": "fiber_spool",
      "stage": 4,
      "text": "合成纤维。部分合成纤维以石化单体为原料；具体路线取决于纤维品种与工厂配置。",
      "hash": "6821f2eb887f5e750c47aac8482b053b58b5db5645a03e4f87d6015eb8676167",
      "file": "tts/6821f2eb887f5e750c47aac8482b053b58b5db5645a03e4f87d6015eb8676167.mp3",
      "bytes": 48528
    },
    {
      "kind": "device",
      "id": "device-lubricant_can",
      "title": "润滑油",
      "objectId": "lubricant_can",
      "stage": 4,
      "text": "润滑油。由适合的馏分经精制、调配与添加剂处理得到，用于减少摩擦与磨损。",
      "hash": "8c92771e9c2b809ef11e9fdca339ae8cacb7ec3dacab7c095f8dda96f76f836f",
      "file": "tts/8c92771e9c2b809ef11e9fdca339ae8cacb7ec3dacab7c095f8dda96f76f836f.mp3",
      "bytes": 49680
    },
    {
      "kind": "device",
      "id": "device-asphalt_slab",
      "title": "沥青路面",
      "objectId": "asphalt_slab",
      "stage": 4,
      "text": "沥青路面。沥青主要来自减压渣油等重质组分，经处理满足道路或建筑用途。",
      "hash": "837042d1e9d82ed17c7eedad51adb7288b0619595afee2c6d33a0ad41af4020e",
      "file": "tts/837042d1e9d82ed17c7eedad51adb7288b0619595afee2c6d33a0ad41af4020e.mp3",
      "bytes": 48528
    },
    {
      "kind": "tour",
      "id": "tour-1",
      "title": "导览第1站",
      "step": 1,
      "text": "这是一条按产业链组织的概念沙盘，不是某一座真实油田，也不是一桶原油的固定加工路线。先看整条路线，再逐站进入。",
      "hash": "a12928df3d8efaa258c4d2bfbcfd90f3834e5af0b4afc0fa90374a2cd0f09e9e",
      "file": "tts/a12928df3d8efaa258c4d2bfbcfd90f3834e5af0b4afc0fa90374a2cd0f09e9e.mp3",
      "bytes": 61200
    },
    {
      "kind": "tour",
      "id": "tour-2",
      "title": "导览第2站",
      "step": 2,
      "text": "油藏不是“油湖”，油赋存在岩石孔隙里。剖面把地表、盖层、储层和井筒放在同一张图上。",
      "hash": "ced15c51cf09ca38a21c423b4509d339ac2a46de6916585f922fd07cd8959ac3",
      "file": "tts/ced15c51cf09ca38a21c423b4509d339ac2a46de6916585f922fd07cd8959ac3.mp3",
      "bytes": 63360
    },
    {
      "kind": "tour",
      "id": "tour-3",
      "title": "导览第3站",
      "step": 3,
      "text": "井筒从地面贯穿到储层。套管、水泥环、油管和射孔段各司其职；这里的剖面是地质教学示意。",
      "hash": "26ef792595e40cf860ab304750a2c11893a873062b400ef36c93badfc246ff30",
      "file": "tts/26ef792595e40cf860ab304750a2c11893a873062b400ef36c93badfc246ff30.mp3",
      "bytes": 61488
    },
    {
      "kind": "tour",
      "id": "tour-4",
      "title": "导览第4站",
      "step": 4,
      "text": "井口采油树把地下产出的混合物接到地面管线。抽油机、阀组和集输管线是连续流程的接口。",
      "hash": "94c179769ddb280ef29372df01d11683d50ea4a71132f8837ebb7ac4de2d1138",
      "file": "tts/94c179769ddb280ef29372df01d11683d50ea4a71132f8837ebb7ac4de2d1138.mp3",
      "bytes": 54000
    },
    {
      "kind": "tour",
      "id": "tour-5",
      "title": "导览第5站",
      "step": 5,
      "text": "井口产出物是油、气、水的混合物。三相分离器按相态和密度把它们分开，再分别送去储存或处理。",
      "hash": "2fa3b34b684ca6d8c75c1a119d327211aa06edddbc5e86b56aec64a8db3134a5",
      "file": "tts/2fa3b34b684ca6d8c75c1a119d327211aa06edddbc5e86b56aec64a8db3134a5.mp3",
      "bytes": 60048
    },
    {
      "kind": "tour",
      "id": "tour-6",
      "title": "导览第6站",
      "step": 6,
      "text": "外浮顶罐的浮盘贴着液面，能减少油气空间；但它不等于零损耗，密封、附件和维护状态仍然重要。",
      "hash": "b04457c2285b769b0f818d5472d88e75fbd38cbad95ca77f5f96b0d77e061b9b",
      "file": "tts/b04457c2285b769b0f818d5472d88e75fbd38cbad95ca77f5f96b0d77e061b9b.mp3",
      "bytes": 57168
    },
    {
      "kind": "tour",
      "id": "tour-7",
      "title": "导览第7站",
      "step": 7,
      "text": "常压蒸馏按沸点范围把原油切成馏分。先看全剖：塔板、降液管和侧线让汽液接触与分离可见。",
      "hash": "7b3c7d3063f39a21ba582f7908f7e43a19b11ad530c8053a59d50ec841cd7f8b",
      "file": "tts/7b3c7d3063f39a21ba582f7908f7e43a19b11ad530c8053a59d50ec841cd7f8b.mp3",
      "bytes": 55728
    },
    {
      "kind": "tour",
      "id": "tour-8",
      "title": "导览第8站",
      "step": 8,
      "text": "柴油是较重的中下部侧线馏分。馏分不是成品油，还要经过加氢、调和等后续加工；路线是典型示意。",
      "hash": "5b64530e2de1a74b520defeaa809361968d9f220c32083b7fa969f2ec66220e2",
      "file": "tts/5b64530e2de1a74b520defeaa809361968d9f220c32083b7fa969f2ec66220e2.mp3",
      "bytes": 54432
    },
    {
      "kind": "tour",
      "id": "tour-9",
      "title": "导览第9站",
      "step": 9,
      "text": "燃料、材料、路面来自不同馏分和加工路线。塑料不一定来自石油，也可能来自天然气、煤基或生物基。",
      "hash": "ed8f4e6e1e438fb05cd49538a7261cc02ccbbb89baa69597ccba9c5a57e3500c",
      "file": "tts/ed8f4e6e1e438fb05cd49538a7261cc02ccbbb89baa69597ccba9c5a57e3500c.mp3",
      "bytes": 59760
    },
    {
      "kind": "tour",
      "id": "tour-10",
      "title": "导览第10站",
      "step": 10,
      "text": "五个环节连成一条产业链。你刚刚走过的设备、知识点和选择已写入本机探索档案；可以再走一次，也可以自由探索。",
      "hash": "d5bf6861b32b17ae38a189f8c65cf0afabca33bfda7135e36286288f097ee724",
      "file": "tts/d5bf6861b32b17ae38a189f8c65cf0afabca33bfda7135e36286288f097ee724.mp3",
      "bytes": 63072
    },
    {
      "kind": "mission",
      "id": "mission-1",
      "title": "任务第1步",
      "step": 1,
      "text": "在 01 地下开采里完成：① 点击储层；② 把压力差滑块拖到 50% 以上，观察流体沿井筒上升。。线索：先点击储层，观察油滴从孔隙汇入井筒并向上抽取：油不是“油湖”，而是在岩石孔隙里。",
      "hash": "a9e09cb63fc27a91e7ea5aa17f1b6e23c3d88a2639db2d5f2e8a2ed9f2afd62a",
      "file": "tts/a9e09cb63fc27a91e7ea5aa17f1b6e23c3d88a2639db2d5f2e8a2ed9f2afd62a.mp3",
      "bytes": 122400
    },
    {
      "kind": "mission",
      "id": "mission-2",
      "title": "任务第2步",
      "step": 2,
      "text": "剖开分离器，启动分离，为气、油、水三路都选对去向。。线索：气比油轻，水比油重；每个出口只能去它该去的地方。",
      "hash": "bf1a7e004fa3adaf081ae4fa6650f9af7c992b571a73ead99fe5b2ce530f09ad",
      "file": "tts/bf1a7e004fa3adaf081ae4fa6650f9af7c992b571a73ead99fe5b2ce530f09ad.mp3",
      "bytes": 77472
    },
    {
      "kind": "mission",
      "id": "mission-3",
      "title": "任务第3步",
      "step": 3,
      "text": "在 03 储运里把液位调到 70% 以上，观察固定顶与外浮顶的油气空间差异。。线索：外浮顶罐的浮盘贴着液面；固定顶罐的油气空间更大。",
      "hash": "0702b32dedbaa598ad70610733d310bf87e9ebb62ae9bd106d162ebb04ce019b",
      "file": "tts/0702b32dedbaa598ad70610733d310bf87e9ebb62ae9bd106d162ebb04ce019b.mp3",
      "bytes": 79200
    },
    {
      "kind": "mission",
      "id": "mission-4",
      "title": "任务第4步",
      "step": 4,
      "text": "在 04 炼化里切到“全剖”，再选择“柴油馏分”。。线索：柴油是较重的中下部侧线馏分；全剖才看得到塔板和侧线。",
      "hash": "57a9cb6a7def2bf3a3ced566f38773f78fbcdd5ed4d505210f2388b2f6cc5cba",
      "file": "tts/57a9cb6a7def2bf3a3ced566f38773f78fbcdd5ed4d505210f2388b2f6cc5cba.mp3",
      "bytes": 69120
    },
    {
      "kind": "mission",
      "id": "mission-5",
      "title": "任务第5步",
      "step": 5,
      "text": "在 05 产品去向里至少选择一个石油路线产品。。线索：点产品台上的物品，看看哪些来自石油路线；塑料也可能来自天然气、煤基或生物基。",
      "hash": "47fa78c549e6aaf02785289d0b68f744107a52786a4b713db19e8a172d516d88",
      "file": "tts/47fa78c549e6aaf02785289d0b68f744107a52786a4b713db19e8a172d516d88.mp3",
      "bytes": 83088
    }
  ]
}
